WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.849 --> 00:00:02.510
Wow, thank you...

00:00:02.510 --> 00:00:05.870
everybody
Relieved -- and finally free.

00:00:05.870 --> 00:00:14.370
After hours hiding in toilet stalls, and under
desks ...

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:20.940
We just closed the doors and then gunshots
were just being sprayed all over.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:22.031
From the top.

00:00:22.031 --> 00:00:26.430
I think they went to the top floor and then
they started spraying bullets.

00:00:26.430 --> 00:00:34.530
Just when I reached the ground floor, I saw
a woman get shot and then that`s when I took

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:37.219
the stairs back to the first floor.

00:00:37.219 --> 00:00:43.629
And then someone locked me outside because
I am not from their office and then we went

00:00:43.629 --> 00:00:48.989
to the washrooms, we were like seven people
in the same washroom.

00:00:48.989 --> 00:00:54.949
From outside the hotel, a friend tried to
give reassurances by cellphone during the

00:00:54.949 --> 00:00:55.949
12 hour ordeal.

00:00:55.949 --> 00:00:58.451
So I had to keep telling her `just wait, help
is on the way, they are almost there, they

00:00:58.451 --> 00:00:59.451
are almost there`.

00:00:59.451 --> 00:01:00.451
And then at one point she was like `please
tell me I am getting out of here alive` and

00:01:00.451 --> 00:01:01.451
then it was just like my breaking point.

00:01:01.451 --> 00:01:06.090
CCTV showed the gunmen entering the hotel
complex before the attack.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:12.010
Within hours - Somali-based terrorist group
Al Shabaab had claimed responsibility.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:17.000
The morning after the attack Kenya's president
gave a defiant televised address, confirming

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:23.039
the siege was over - and that all the Islamists
involved had been eliminated.

00:01:23.039 --> 00:01:37.159
We have shown Kenyans and the world we are
are ready to deal with any threat to our nation.

00:01:37.159 --> 00:01:42.399
But many Kenyans are sceptical at the government's
ability to protect them.

00:01:42.399 --> 00:01:49.979
We are blaming our internal security staff
because how did these people get into our

00:01:49.979 --> 00:01:58.399
country and we have all of our security around.

00:01:58.399 --> 00:03:22.500
This latest deadly assault in Nairobi shows
the Al quaeda linked group remains a force

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:39.010
for

00:03:39.010 --> 00:04:33.160
the Kenyan

00:04:33.160 --> 00:05:02.440
government

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:09.430
to reckon with.

